WEBVTT

00:05:29.909 --> 00:05:33.120
is not just confined
to the early Middle East.

00:05:33.954 --> 00:05:35.289
It’s everything:

00:05:35.331 --> 00:05:39.418
out whole picture of human history
that we’ve been telling for centuries,

00:05:39.877 --> 00:05:41.712
it’s basically wrong.

00:05:41.712 --> 00:05:45.758
I'm going to try and explain
a few more of the reasons why.

00:05:46.133 --> 00:05:48.969
Let's go back to some
of those core concepts,

00:05:49.011 --> 00:05:53.641
the stable reference points
around which we've been organizing

00:05:53.682 --> 00:05:58.687
and orchestrating our understanding
of world history for hundreds of years.

00:05:59.522 --> 00:06:03.401
Take, for instance, that notion
that for most of its history,